    "description": "A C++ code for graph-based and geologically-driven simulation of 3D karst networks. It generates realistic karst conduit networks honoring geological data (fractures, inception surfaces, water tables, connectivity) using a shortest-path approach on graphs, with optional amplification and conduit-size simulation steps.",
